WEBVTT

00:13.170 --> 00:15.180
<b>[low note resonates, intensifying]</b>

00:18.390 --> 00:19.850
<b>[Yasuke] This is all we have?</b>

00:22.890 --> 00:24.440
<b>We're a school.</b>

00:24.520 --> 00:26.190
<b>You said you were a resistance.</b>

00:26.770 --> 00:27.730
<b>Hmm.</b>

00:29.020 --> 00:29.900
<b>In progress.</b>

00:32.400 --> 00:34.070
<b>That's why we need you.</b>

00:34.150 --> 00:35.410
<b>[quietly] Hmm.</b>

00:35.910 --> 00:38.950
<b>We're not prepared for this.
We'll be slaughtered.</b>

00:39.030 --> 00:42.080
<b>Perhaps we give them what they want.
Protect the village.</b>

00:42.160 --> 00:43.460
<b>That is not an option.</b>

00:43.540 --> 00:46.960
<b>The longer they stay here,
the less likely we leave here alive.</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:48.590
<b>No one is leaving anything.</b>

00:50.050 --> 00:54.470
<b>The girl came here for protection.
So, we make a stand and fight.</b>

00:54.550 --> 00:55.760
<b>[footsteps approaching]</b>

00:55.840 --> 00:56.970
<b>[door opens]</b>

00:57.050 --> 00:59.970
<b>[panicked]
He's here! The Dark General, he's here!</b>

01:00.060 --> 01:02.060
<b>[armor clinking]</b>

01:04.810 --> 01:06.640
<b>[wind howling]</b>

01:14.070 --> 01:16.030
<b>["Black Gold" by Flying Lotus playing]</b>

01:16.110 --> 01:19.530
<b>♪ Brought in a world ♪</b>

01:20.200 --> 01:25.710
<b>♪ World so brand new
Endless possibilities ♪</b>

01:27.000 --> 01:30.880
<b>♪ A whole new identity ♪</b>

01:31.380 --> 01:33.630
<b>♪ Can't you see? ♪</b>

01:34.380 --> 01:38.220
<b>♪ Black gold of the sun ♪</b>

01:38.300 --> 01:40.970
<b>♪ Open up your eyes ♪</b>

01:41.050 --> 01:43.640
<b>♪ Open up your heart ♪</b>

01:43.720 --> 01:46.560
<b>♪ And feel the sunshine ♪</b>

01:46.640 --> 01:48.980
<b>♪ Black diamond ♪</b>

01:49.480 --> 01:52.150
<b>♪ I just want to be ♪</b>

01:52.230 --> 01:54.900
<b>♪ Where I'm supposed to be ♪</b>

01:55.940 --> 01:58.570
<b>♪ And that's right here with you ♪</b>

02:10.460 --> 02:15.170
<b>♪ Don't mistake my kindness for weakness ♪</b>

02:15.260 --> 02:17.920
<b>♪ 'Cause I'm strong, you see ♪</b>

02:18.010 --> 02:20.970
<b>♪ Stronger than you'll ever be ♪</b>

02:22.930 --> 02:25.350
<b>♪ Loyal to me ♪</b>

02:25.430 --> 02:28.270
<b>♪ Someone to call my friend ♪</b>

02:28.350 --> 02:31.190
<b>♪ Whenever you need me ♪</b>

02:31.270 --> 02:34.020
<b>♪ I'll be right here ♪</b>

02:34.110 --> 02:36.400
<b>♪ Love and loyalty ♪</b>

02:36.900 --> 02:39.490
<b>♪ Trust and honesty ♪</b>

02:40.610 --> 02:43.120
<b>♪ I'll never let go ♪</b>

02:51.290 --> 02:53.290
<b>[ominous music plays]</b>

02:56.960 --> 03:00.090
<b>[Morisuke] We thought
they'd never find us. We were wrong.</b>

03:00.180 --> 03:01.840
<b>We have little time now.</b>

03:03.260 --> 03:04.220
<b>[sighs]</b>

03:04.300 --> 03:06.510
<b>Are you sure he'll take the bait?</b>

03:06.600 --> 03:07.520
<b>He will.</b>

03:07.600 --> 03:10.100
<b>For all our sake, I hope you're right.</b>

03:10.190 --> 03:15.150
<b>If not, I fear this day will end
as it did all those years ago.</b>

03:15.230 --> 03:16.610
<b>-[thumping]
-[Saki moans]</b>

03:16.690 --> 03:19.070
<b>[groaning] Ya-- Yassan!</b>

03:19.150 --> 03:19.990
<b>[groans]</b>

03:20.070 --> 03:21.490
<b>Saki, what's wrong?</b>

03:21.570 --> 03:23.280
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

03:24.620 --> 03:26.530
<b>-Get out of my head!
-[Yasuke] Saki!</b>

03:26.620 --> 03:27.580
<b>Stay back.</b>

03:30.120 --> 03:33.210
<b>The Daimyo is reaching out
to her on the Astral Plane.</b>

03:33.290 --> 03:34.380
<b>To do what?</b>

03:34.460 --> 03:36.670
<b>The Daimyo is from the ancient times.</b>

03:36.750 --> 03:39.380
<b>Even someone like her cannot live forever.</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:43.550
<b>Saki's powers can rejuvenate her,
helping her live another century.</b>

03:43.640 --> 03:45.350
<b>-[moans]
-Saki.</b>

03:45.850 --> 03:46.930
<b>How do we stop it?</b>

03:47.010 --> 03:51.640
<b>She must be using the Dark General
as a conduit to connect to her mind.</b>

03:51.730 --> 03:53.310
<b>How much time do we have?</b>

03:53.390 --> 03:54.650
<b>Not long.</b>

03:54.730 --> 03:59.190
<b>I may be able to assist,
but she will have to fight this herself.</b>

03:59.280 --> 04:01.070
<b>She's not ready for that.</b>

04:04.200 --> 04:06.280
<b>You're no match for him, Yasuke.</b>

04:06.370 --> 04:09.450
<b>Not with the Daimyo's dark magic
on his side.</b>

04:09.950 --> 04:11.660
<b>Will your men be in position?</b>

04:11.750 --> 04:12.790
<b>They'll make it.</b>

04:13.370 --> 04:14.290
<b>Bring her back.</b>

04:14.370 --> 04:15.210
<b>I will.</b>

04:17.750 --> 04:20.000
<b>[whooshing]</b>

04:20.090 --> 04:22.800
<b>[urgent, ethereal music playing]</b>

04:24.840 --> 04:25.970
<b>Saki.</b>

04:26.050 --> 04:29.260
<b>-[Saki, echoing] Help me!
-[distant rumbling]</b>

04:37.810 --> 04:38.980
<b>[panting]</b>

04:39.070 --> 04:41.030
<b>[slow drumbeats thud]</b>

04:44.240 --> 04:47.530
<b>Today, we fight for the future of Japan.</b>

04:50.660 --> 04:51.660
<b>[horse whinnies]</b>

04:51.740 --> 04:53.750
<b>[light drum rhythm plays]</b>

04:59.880 --> 05:01.670
<b>[horse neighs]</b>

05:01.750 --> 05:04.670
<b>The village
will not surrender to people like you.</b>

05:05.430 --> 05:07.430
<b>[wind whistles]</b>

05:08.260 --> 05:10.100
<b>I wish to settle this.</b>

05:10.180 --> 05:11.430
<b>The old way.</b>

05:11.510 --> 05:13.020
<b>[exhales deeply]</b>

05:13.100 --> 05:14.180
<b>[horse nickers]</b>

05:17.230 --> 05:18.060
<b>[horse snorts]</b>

05:26.240 --> 05:27.530
<b>[in harsh voice] Yasuke,</b>

05:27.610 --> 05:29.780
<b>I should have killed you
along with Nobutada,</b>

05:29.870 --> 05:32.080
<b>but I granted you mercy that night.</b>

05:32.160 --> 05:34.620
<b>Mitsuhide, what has become of you?</b>

05:35.120 --> 05:36.910
<b>There's still time for you.</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:39.290
<b>We can unite
and save Japan from this horror.</b>

05:39.380 --> 05:43.420
<b>You continue to follow
the false teachings of a dead man.</b>

05:43.500 --> 05:44.880
<b>Look at yourself.</b>

05:44.960 --> 05:46.920
<b>It is the Daimyo
that feeds you these lies.</b>

05:47.010 --> 05:50.220
<b>She has twisted your soul
and turned you against your own people.</b>

05:50.300 --> 05:54.970
<b>It was Nobunaga who turned his back
on our people when he took you in!</b>

05:55.060 --> 05:57.980
<b>I helped liberate them
from his toxic ways,</b>

05:58.060 --> 06:01.110
<b>and now Japan lives.</b>

06:02.440 --> 06:04.480
<b>Japan lives in fear.</b>

06:04.570 --> 06:06.690
<b>The Daimyo's reign is hell on earth.</b>

06:06.780 --> 06:10.240
<b>You don't know hell, but I will show you.</b>

06:11.030 --> 06:14.700
<b>But first, I will break your spirit.</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:17.710
<b>Then your body!</b>

06:17.790 --> 06:20.120
<b>[dramatic choral swell]</b>

06:20.790 --> 06:23.090
<b>There is no honor to be had here.</b>

06:23.170 --> 06:26.460
<b>Only pain and blood.</b>

06:27.170 --> 06:28.670
<b>-[grunts]
-[clanging]</b>

06:28.760 --> 06:30.260
<b>[wind whooshing]</b>

06:30.340 --> 06:31.720
<b>[laughs]</b>

06:31.800 --> 06:34.140
<b>[grunting]</b>

06:34.850 --> 06:37.230
<b>[rhythmic electronic music plays]</b>

06:38.600 --> 06:39.520
<b>[groans]</b>

06:40.310 --> 06:42.230
<b>-[laughs]
-[grunts]</b>

06:47.860 --> 06:50.700
<b>[breathing heavily]
You stormed our gates with the enemy.</b>

06:50.780 --> 06:53.200
<b>Your betrayal
ate away at Nobunaga's heart.</b>

06:53.780 --> 06:55.830
<b>He's dead because of you.</b>

06:55.910 --> 06:57.250
<b>Or is he dead</b>

06:57.330 --> 07:00.370
<b>because his loyal servant
chopped off his head?</b>

07:02.540 --> 07:05.340
<b>-[soft whooshing]
-[rumbling]</b>

07:11.720 --> 07:13.090
<b>-Saki.
-[gasps]</b>

07:13.760 --> 07:15.600
<b>I'm cold. I can't move.</b>

07:15.680 --> 07:18.350
<b>It's okay.
I'm going to get you out of here.</b>

07:20.020 --> 07:20.850
<b>Are we…?</b>

07:20.940 --> 07:24.980
<b>[Morisuke] We are in the Astral Plane.
A spiritual place between life and death.</b>

07:25.060 --> 07:26.610
<b>[pulsing, shimmering sound]</b>

07:26.690 --> 07:28.570
<b>[gasps] What's happening?</b>

07:28.650 --> 07:32.860
<b>Saki, I need you to listen to me.
What happens next will be painful.</b>

07:32.950 --> 07:34.990
<b>It will feel like being ripped in half.</b>

07:35.070 --> 07:38.120
<b>You'll need to concentrate
and try to keep yourself together.</b>

07:38.200 --> 07:39.790
<b>I don't understand!</b>

07:39.870 --> 07:42.170
<b>-[pulsing intensifies]
-[Saki screams]</b>

07:42.250 --> 07:44.630
<b>You don't have time to understand.</b>

07:49.300 --> 07:52.340
<b>[Daimyo, echoing] Morisuke.</b>

07:55.680 --> 07:58.390
<b>You will not claim this child.</b>

07:58.470 --> 08:00.430
<b>[eerie note resonates]</b>

08:00.520 --> 08:02.520
<b>I already have.</b>

08:02.600 --> 08:05.770
<b>The devil reveals herself
from the shadows.</b>

08:06.360 --> 08:09.690
<b>Just as the sun sets, darkness falls.</b>

08:09.780 --> 08:14.910
<b>It is neither good nor bad,
just the natural order of creation itself.</b>

08:15.780 --> 08:19.910
<b>And now that balance
tilts towards the night.</b>

08:19.990 --> 08:22.910
<b>I am the dark.</b>

08:23.000 --> 08:25.370
<b>[whooshing]</b>

08:25.460 --> 08:28.040
<b>[pulsing blasts]</b>

08:28.670 --> 08:31.670
<b>This child is under my protection.</b>

08:31.760 --> 08:34.550
<b>You shall not have her.</b>

08:36.090 --> 08:37.260
<b>[whooshing]</b>

08:38.850 --> 08:39.760
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

08:39.850 --> 08:41.560
<b>[groaning]</b>

08:41.640 --> 08:43.520
<b>[screaming]</b>

08:43.600 --> 08:44.850
<b>[grunts]</b>

08:47.520 --> 08:49.520
<b>[suspenseful electronic music plays]</b>

08:51.230 --> 08:52.530
<b>Is that all you got?</b>

08:52.610 --> 08:53.650
<b>[sighs]</b>

08:54.150 --> 08:57.660
<b>Perhaps your body
will break before your spirit.</b>

08:57.740 --> 08:59.410
<b>[grunts lightly, sighs]</b>

09:01.740 --> 09:03.660
<b>[running footsteps]</b>

09:16.090 --> 09:18.050
<b>The old way does not suit you.</b>

09:18.550 --> 09:20.050
<b>It never did.</b>

09:20.140 --> 09:21.680
<b>You're right.</b>

09:21.760 --> 09:24.060
<b>The old way does not suit me.</b>

09:24.640 --> 09:25.850
<b>That's why I lied.</b>

09:25.940 --> 09:27.650
<b>-What?
-Now!</b>

09:28.350 --> 09:30.480
<b>[mellow electronic music plays]</b>

09:33.570 --> 09:34.990
<b>[groaning, grunting]</b>

09:40.240 --> 09:41.870
<b>[pulsing whoosh]</b>

09:44.450 --> 09:46.120
<b>[pulsing whooshes]</b>

09:51.210 --> 09:52.500
<b>What is this?</b>

09:53.710 --> 09:55.010
<b>You flanked us?</b>

09:57.220 --> 09:58.510
<b>You were stalling?</b>

10:02.970 --> 10:04.970
<b>[shouting]</b>

10:05.680 --> 10:07.850
<b>Finally, a challenge!</b>

10:07.940 --> 10:09.940
<b>[battle cries approaching]</b>

10:10.690 --> 10:12.060
<b>[yells]</b>

10:14.030 --> 10:14.860
<b>[swords clang]</b>

10:14.940 --> 10:16.940
<b>[grunting softly]</b>

10:17.570 --> 10:19.990
<b>[labored breathing]</b>

10:24.040 --> 10:24.870
<b>[Saki gasps]</b>

10:25.370 --> 10:26.660
<b>[stifled] Help me!</b>

10:28.290 --> 10:29.580
<b>Hold on, Saki!</b>

10:29.670 --> 10:31.580
<b>-[shimmering sound]
-[Saki panting]</b>

10:35.590 --> 10:39.380
<b>[Daimyo] Your magic
is impressive for a mortal,</b>

10:39.470 --> 10:42.800
<b>but this is only
your first visit to the Astral Plane.</b>

10:43.300 --> 10:47.180
<b>I was trapped here for hundreds of years,</b>

10:47.270 --> 10:49.060
<b>molded by it.</b>

10:49.770 --> 10:51.400
<b>[shimmering blasts]</b>

10:51.480 --> 10:53.520
<b>[wind howling]</b>

10:53.610 --> 10:55.900
<b>[Morisuke] Saki, can you hear me?</b>

10:55.980 --> 10:59.530
<b>I am communicating to you
through a telekinetic link.</b>

10:59.610 --> 11:01.280
<b>[Saki] What is happening to me?</b>

11:01.360 --> 11:04.910
<b>[Morisuke] The Daimyo is absorbing you
into her astral force.</b>

11:04.990 --> 11:07.910
<b>When complete,
your power will become her power.</b>

11:08.540 --> 11:10.040
<b>[Saki] What happens to me?</b>

11:10.120 --> 11:11.920
<b>[Morisuke] You will cease to exist.</b>

11:12.420 --> 11:14.460
<b>[Saki] Please, Morisuke. Help me!</b>

11:14.540 --> 11:16.380
<b>[pulsing blasts]</b>

11:21.590 --> 11:25.300
<b>[Morisuke] I do not have the power
to help you. She's too strong.</b>

11:25.390 --> 11:27.350
<b>Only you can defeat her.</b>

11:27.430 --> 11:29.480
<b>[Saki] How? I can't move!</b>

11:29.560 --> 11:31.810
<b>[Morisuke]
You are in the metaphysical world.</b>

11:31.890 --> 11:33.230
<b>You don't have to move.</b>

11:33.310 --> 11:35.440
<b>You are connected to all living things.</b>

11:35.520 --> 11:38.190
<b>Their power is an extension of yours.</b>

11:38.280 --> 11:39.690
<b>Tap into it.</b>

11:39.780 --> 11:42.610
<b>[Saki] I'm scared. I can't do this.</b>

11:42.700 --> 11:45.870
<b>[Morisuke] Yes, you can. Free your mind.</b>

11:47.950 --> 11:49.750
<b>[light shimmering sound]</b>

11:49.830 --> 11:51.830
<b>[mellow electronic music plays]</b>

11:56.540 --> 11:57.750
<b>[whoosh]</b>

11:57.840 --> 12:00.880
<b>[ethereal note resonates]</b>

12:04.720 --> 12:06.600
<b>[bright shimmering sound]</b>

12:08.560 --> 12:09.680
<b>[Saki] I can feel it.</b>

12:10.560 --> 12:11.390
<b>[gasps]</b>

12:16.360 --> 12:17.690
<b>[bright shimmering sound]</b>

12:27.740 --> 12:29.580
<b>[ethereal hum]</b>

12:29.660 --> 12:31.790
<b>[hum intensifying]</b>

12:31.870 --> 12:33.830
<b>-[hum peaks and stops]
-[yelling]</b>

12:33.910 --> 12:36.080
<b>[loud crash]</b>

12:36.170 --> 12:37.710
<b>[men screaming]</b>

12:39.550 --> 12:42.210
<b>[shattering, shimmering sound]</b>

12:42.300 --> 12:43.920
<b>[jagged tinkling]</b>

12:46.430 --> 12:47.340
<b>Huh?</b>

12:50.930 --> 12:53.980
<b>[shimmering, pulsing sound]</b>

12:59.020 --> 13:00.940
<b>[pulsating whoosh]</b>

13:04.950 --> 13:08.660
<b>So, you learned
how to tap into the life force.</b>

13:08.740 --> 13:10.660
<b>And now I will defeat you!</b>

13:10.740 --> 13:12.200
<b>Little girl.</b>

13:12.290 --> 13:15.040
<b>You still have so much to learn.</b>

13:15.500 --> 13:16.420
<b>[grunts]</b>

13:17.580 --> 13:19.420
<b>[Daimyo laughing]</b>

13:27.300 --> 13:29.300
<b>Hmm…</b>

13:32.560 --> 13:33.430
<b>[grunts softly]</b>

13:35.640 --> 13:36.690
<b>[grunts softly]</b>

13:37.600 --> 13:38.940
<b>[explosions]</b>

13:39.020 --> 13:40.360
<b>We can help them.</b>

13:42.780 --> 13:45.690
<b>It's too dangerous.
If we lose you, we lose everything.</b>

13:45.780 --> 13:47.450
<b>There's nothing we can do.</b>

13:49.740 --> 13:50.870
<b>Maybe there is.</b>

13:51.780 --> 13:54.450
<b>[man groaning, grunts]</b>

13:54.540 --> 13:56.580
<b>[retching, panting]</b>

13:57.790 --> 14:00.460
<b>[Mitsuhide] What is happening to me?</b>

14:00.540 --> 14:02.420
<b>[unsettling music plays]</b>

14:02.500 --> 14:04.710
<b>No. No, no. No!</b>

14:04.800 --> 14:06.800
<b>[grunting]</b>

14:12.300 --> 14:14.640
<b>-[swords clashing]
-[grunting]</b>

14:14.720 --> 14:16.640
<b>[men shouting]</b>

14:19.350 --> 14:21.270
<b>[soldiers grunting, groaning]</b>

14:21.860 --> 14:25.320
<b>[Mitsuhide] Go through the mountain.
Blast through the mountain!</b>

14:28.360 --> 14:29.740
<b>[crackling]</b>

14:29.820 --> 14:32.280
<b>[whooshing]</b>

14:32.370 --> 14:33.740
<b>[boom]</b>

14:34.790 --> 14:36.790
<b>[wind whooshing]</b>

14:37.960 --> 14:39.250
<b>[pulsating whoosh]</b>

14:39.330 --> 14:41.670
<b>[resounding crash]</b>

14:45.340 --> 14:48.340
<b>It seems the Daimyo's dark magic
no longer courses through you.</b>

14:48.920 --> 14:53.600
<b>I don't need her magic
to defeat you, servant!</b>

14:53.680 --> 14:55.680
<b>-[both grunting]
-[swords clanging]</b>

14:55.760 --> 14:57.770
<b>[energized electronic music plays]</b>

14:57.850 --> 14:59.140
<b>[rumbling]</b>

14:59.230 --> 15:01.190
<b>-[crackling]
-[boom]</b>

15:05.400 --> 15:07.320
<b>[all shouting]</b>

15:10.910 --> 15:11.950
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:12.030 --> 15:14.700
<b>[energized electronic music playing]</b>

15:17.830 --> 15:19.500
<b>Don't look surprised.</b>

15:20.040 --> 15:23.830
<b>You really thought
you could outmaneuver me in battle?</b>

15:23.920 --> 15:28.090
<b>Now this village will fall,
just like all the others.</b>

15:28.800 --> 15:31.090
<b>No one can withstand our might.</b>

15:31.680 --> 15:32.640
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

15:33.640 --> 15:35.930
<b>[men whimpering]</b>

15:36.010 --> 15:37.220
<b>-[blasts]
-[boom]</b>

15:37.310 --> 15:39.430
<b>[whirring, boom]</b>

15:39.520 --> 15:41.020
<b>[men shouting]</b>

15:41.100 --> 15:42.980
<b>[jagged tinkling]</b>

15:43.060 --> 15:44.730
<b>[loud thud]</b>

15:44.810 --> 15:47.610
<b>[steady drum rhythm plays]</b>

15:48.440 --> 15:50.150
<b>[whirring]</b>

15:50.240 --> 15:52.610
<b>-[boom]
-[grunting]</b>

15:54.410 --> 15:55.740
<b>Ice cold.</b>

15:55.820 --> 15:57.200
<b>Please, no.</b>

15:58.290 --> 16:00.290
<b>[clamor of battle continues]</b>

16:01.330 --> 16:02.960
<b>[arrows whizzing]</b>

16:05.460 --> 16:07.380
<b>I hate to interrupt this dance,</b>

16:07.460 --> 16:10.260
<b>but if you don't mind,
I brought a lady to cut in with.</b>

16:10.340 --> 16:12.590
<b>No holding back for once.</b>

16:12.680 --> 16:14.680
<b>This I like.</b>

16:14.760 --> 16:17.470
<b>[growls, roars]</b>

16:23.060 --> 16:25.060
<b>[men shouting]</b>

16:27.900 --> 16:29.440
<b>Change to pulse rounds.</b>

16:29.530 --> 16:30.990
<b>Affirmative, pilot.</b>

16:33.740 --> 16:35.360
<b>[pulsing, blasting]</b>

16:38.120 --> 16:39.280
<b>[steady drumbeat plays]</b>

16:41.200 --> 16:43.290
<b>[supernatural hum]</b>

16:43.370 --> 16:45.290
<b>[intensifying whoosh]</b>

16:53.670 --> 16:54.840
<b>[grunting]</b>

16:58.100 --> 16:59.350
<b>It's over, Mitsuhide.</b>

16:59.430 --> 17:02.020
<b>That's not my name, servant.</b>

17:02.100 --> 17:04.060
<b>I am the Dark General!</b>

17:08.150 --> 17:10.820
<b>[screams]</b>

17:22.830 --> 17:24.540
<b>[coughing]</b>

17:24.620 --> 17:26.290
<b>[groans weakly]</b>

17:28.750 --> 17:30.710
<b>The Black Samurai.</b>

17:30.790 --> 17:32.550
<b>[coughing]</b>

17:32.630 --> 17:33.960
<b>[wheezing]</b>

17:34.470 --> 17:36.720
<b>You will always be a servant,</b>

17:37.300 --> 17:40.140
<b>no matter what armor you wear.</b>

17:47.440 --> 17:48.730
<b>I serve no man.</b>

17:49.310 --> 17:50.650
<b>[chuckles]</b>

18:06.750 --> 18:10.290
<b>[hissing]</b>

18:13.920 --> 18:16.840
<b>-[people gasping, murmuring]
-[indistinct murmuring]</b>

18:16.920 --> 18:17.930
<b>Yassan!</b>

18:18.010 --> 18:20.090
<b>-[indistinct chattering]
-[Saki sighs]</b>

18:21.010 --> 18:22.220
<b>You made it.</b>

18:22.300 --> 18:24.720
<b>I went to a place called the Astral Plane.</b>

18:24.810 --> 18:27.640
<b>It has colorful clouds
and stars and black holes.</b>

18:29.480 --> 18:30.480
<b>[woman] Wow.</b>

18:31.690 --> 18:33.690
<b>[overlapping whispers]</b>

18:34.190 --> 18:36.030
<b>Thank you for your assistance.</b>

18:36.110 --> 18:37.990
<b>Where's the money
we were promised for helping?</b>

18:38.070 --> 18:38.950
<b>Hmm?</b>

18:39.570 --> 18:40.610
<b>What money?</b>

18:40.700 --> 18:43.160
<b>The girl spoke to us in our heads,</b>

18:43.240 --> 18:47.000
<b>told us to come here and help fight,
and we would be paid double our rate.</b>

18:47.080 --> 18:50.120
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

18:50.210 --> 18:52.710
<b>[sighs] There's a lot
we must catch you up on.</b>

18:52.790 --> 18:55.550
<b>I'm sure we could come to some agreement.</b>

18:57.090 --> 18:58.550
<b>[villager] She's so tall.</b>

18:59.420 --> 19:00.930
<b>And strong.</b>

19:01.010 --> 19:03.800
<b>So, you're a samurai?</b>

19:03.890 --> 19:04.810
<b>Yes, I am.</b>

19:04.890 --> 19:06.850
<b>A Black samurai?</b>

19:07.600 --> 19:09.850
<b>And here I thought I'd seen it all.</b>

19:11.520 --> 19:12.860
<b>Not bad, Chernyy.</b>

19:13.440 --> 19:14.940
<b>Not bad at all.</b>

19:18.030 --> 19:20.030
<b>[crows cawing]</b>

19:24.030 --> 19:25.830
<b>[beeping]</b>

19:26.410 --> 19:27.580
<b>[alert blaring]</b>

19:27.660 --> 19:29.830
<b>[woman] Will you
shut that thing up already?</b>

19:29.910 --> 19:32.080
<b>[robot] The trackers indicate incoming.</b>

19:32.170 --> 19:34.210
<b>[woman] Look for yourself, my friend.</b>

19:34.290 --> 19:36.340
<b>Everyone is dead.</b>

19:36.420 --> 19:40.090
<b>We killed them. Wouldn't mind
doing it again, if you ask me.</b>

19:40.840 --> 19:44.390
<b>Friend is a word used to describe
someone you're happy to spend time with.</b>

19:44.470 --> 19:47.140
<b>Yeah. I guess you could say that.</b>

19:47.720 --> 19:50.140
<b>I enjoy killing people with you.</b>

19:50.230 --> 19:53.270
<b>I guess that makes us… friends.</b>

19:53.350 --> 19:54.520
<b>Hmm.</b>

19:54.610 --> 19:56.650
<b>Yes, friends.</b>

19:56.730 --> 19:58.030
<b>[alert blaring]</b>

19:58.110 --> 20:00.990
<b>Okay, you're malfunctioning again.</b>

20:01.070 --> 20:03.360
<b>It's fine. We all have our problems.</b>

20:03.450 --> 20:05.620
<b>[blaring continues]</b>

20:05.700 --> 20:08.790
<b>Readings indicate
multiple targets incoming, and fast.</b>

20:09.290 --> 20:10.120
<b>Where?</b>

20:10.200 --> 20:13.620
<b>It should be here right about… now.</b>

20:13.710 --> 20:14.880
<b>[thunder rumbles]</b>

20:14.960 --> 20:16.500
<b>Do you see anything yet?</b>

20:17.540 --> 20:18.420
<b>Ishikawa!</b>

20:19.340 --> 20:20.460
<b>[sharp whoosh]</b>

20:21.170 --> 20:22.010
<b>[thud]</b>

20:23.720 --> 20:27.100
<b>What was that?
Rust Bucket, what's going on over there?</b>

20:29.260 --> 20:30.850
<b>Huh? Ishikawa?</b>

20:33.230 --> 20:34.190
<b>Friend?</b>

20:35.100 --> 20:38.320
<b>Friend, sensors indicate
that you are dead.</b>

20:39.230 --> 20:41.990
<b>Is this a malfunction, Ishikawa?</b>

20:42.990 --> 20:45.030
<b>[breathing shakily]</b>

20:45.110 --> 20:45.950
<b>I…</b>

20:47.320 --> 20:48.740
<b>[dramatic drumbeats thud]</b>

20:48.830 --> 20:50.410
<b>[whooshing]</b>

20:51.370 --> 20:52.330
<b>[Yasuke] Cover!</b>

20:55.500 --> 20:56.670
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

21:09.260 --> 21:10.930
<b>-Are you okay?
-Yes.</b>

21:26.820 --> 21:27.660
<b>Friend.</b>

21:28.780 --> 21:30.030
<b>[distant rumbling]</b>

21:31.030 --> 21:32.700
<b>-Huh?
-[gasps]</b>

21:32.790 --> 21:33.750
<b>What?</b>

21:37.170 --> 21:39.880
<b>-[rumbling approaches]
-[rapid drumbeats play]</b>

21:45.670 --> 21:46.840
<b>Close the gates.</b>

21:48.680 --> 21:51.180
<b>Haruto, come. The gates are closing.</b>

21:53.180 --> 21:54.600
<b>Let's go, big guy!</b>

21:59.810 --> 22:01.360
<b>[thrusters whooshing]</b>

22:01.440 --> 22:02.610
<b>[Nikita] No, Haruto!</b>

22:09.110 --> 22:10.070
<b>[beeping]</b>

22:10.160 --> 22:12.450
<b>Self-destruct sequence activated in</b>

22:12.950 --> 22:15.500
<b>ten, nine, eight…</b>

22:17.250 --> 22:19.420
<b>[all panting]</b>

22:19.500 --> 22:21.590
<b>We have to get Saki to the temple.</b>

22:21.670 --> 22:23.380
<b>This is no time to pray, old man.</b>

22:23.460 --> 22:25.710
<b>It seems you made Daimyo very mad.</b>

22:26.210 --> 22:30.590
<b>…four, three, two, one.</b>

22:30.680 --> 22:31.760
<b>Goodbye, friend.</b>

22:31.850 --> 22:34.350
<b>[silence]</b>

22:36.020 --> 22:38.190
<b>[whooshing]</b>

22:38.890 --> 22:40.900
<b>[all shouting]</b>

22:40.980 --> 22:43.860
<b>[grunting, coughing]</b>

22:45.940 --> 22:47.900
<b>-[people gasping]
-Let's go.</b>

22:47.990 --> 22:49.650
<b>[all shouting]</b>

22:50.320 --> 22:51.660
<b>[unsettling music plays]</b>

22:55.870 --> 22:57.790
<b>[all panting]</b>

23:07.420 --> 23:08.260
<b>Nikita!</b>

23:19.980 --> 23:21.400
<b>[all grunting]</b>

23:22.850 --> 23:25.610
<b>Let's see how many of you I kill.</b>

23:28.530 --> 23:30.110
<b>[growls]</b>

23:37.790 --> 23:39.790
<b>[fires crackling]</b>

23:40.790 --> 23:42.170
<b>[roars]</b>

23:44.170 --> 23:46.170
<b>[snarling, straining]</b>

23:54.180 --> 23:56.350
<b>[ethereal whistling]</b>

23:56.430 --> 23:58.600
<b>[growling]</b>

24:05.190 --> 24:08.110
<b>[groaning]</b>

24:12.700 --> 24:14.610
<b>This is not a plan, Morisuke.</b>

24:14.700 --> 24:16.320
<b>We have to get out of here.</b>

24:16.410 --> 24:18.410
<b>[Morisuke] The Daimyo will never stop.</b>

24:18.490 --> 24:21.790
<b>The Dark Army
will always return as long as she lives.</b>

24:24.000 --> 24:26.880
<b>[chains rattling, clinking]</b>

24:26.960 --> 24:29.090
<b>[door creaking]</b>

24:29.170 --> 24:32.510
<b>Take this secret passage.
It will lead you out past the ridge.</b>

24:32.590 --> 24:35.220
<b>-From there, you must go to--
-I know where to go.</b>

24:36.010 --> 24:38.470
<b>Of course you do. Take the girl.</b>

24:38.560 --> 24:40.600
<b>No, she stays.</b>

24:40.680 --> 24:43.810
<b>-You can't defeat her.
-[Yasuke] I'll figure it out.</b>

24:43.890 --> 24:47.020
<b>She's too powerful.
You'll die. We'll all die.</b>

24:47.110 --> 24:49.360
<b>When we were on the Astral Plane,</b>

24:49.440 --> 24:51.360
<b>Saki drove the Daimyo back.</b>

24:51.440 --> 24:53.280
<b>She has the power to defeat her.</b>

24:53.360 --> 24:54.950
<b>She's our only hope.</b>

24:57.160 --> 24:59.030
<b>There's no turning back once we leave.</b>

25:00.620 --> 25:03.410
<b>All right, let's go kill a witch.</b>

25:03.500 --> 25:07.540
<b>No, I need you to stay here
and help defend the women and children.</b>

25:07.630 --> 25:08.920
<b>Sorry, old man.</b>

25:09.000 --> 25:11.210
<b>I don't do chains and dungeons.</b>

25:11.300 --> 25:12.760
<b>I'll triple your rate.</b>

25:15.510 --> 25:17.260
<b>You two kill the witch lady.</b>

25:17.760 --> 25:18.760
<b>After all,</b>

25:19.350 --> 25:21.930
<b>I believe that children are the future.</b>

25:35.530 --> 25:37.240
<b>[door creaks]</b>

25:42.990 --> 25:45.580
<b>["Between Memories" by Flying Lotus plays]</b>

26:03.310 --> 26:04.930
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

26:05.020 --> 26:08.350
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

26:08.850 --> 26:10.980
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

26:11.060 --> 26:15.610
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

26:15.690 --> 26:19.070
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

26:19.570 --> 26:21.700
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

26:21.780 --> 26:25.750
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

26:26.660 --> 26:28.670
<b>[female vocalizing]</b>

26:31.630 --> 26:32.840
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

26:34.880 --> 26:37.380
<b>-[female vocalizing]
-♪ Come on ♪</b>

26:45.020 --> 26:46.890
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

26:46.980 --> 26:48.180
<b>♪ Come on ♪</b>

26:51.650 --> 26:53.650
<b>[girl laughing]</b>
